   "source": [
    "### Word frequency\n",
    "\n",
    "**Takeaway:** lowercase, strip punctuation, split, then `Counter(...).most_common(n)`.\n",
    "\n",
    "- `str.maketrans(\"\", \"\", string.punctuation)` + `translate` deletes punctuation.\n",
    "- `most_common(3)` returns `(word, count)` tuples, highest first.\n",
    "- This cell imports `Counter`, which later cells reuse.\n",
    "\n",
    "⚠️ Name typo (code unchanged): `word_ferquency`.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "11272978",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[('pavan', 4), ('another', 3), ('is', 2)]\n",
      "using Collections.counter to count the frequecy of a character/string \n",
      "Fixed String : hey there  pavan is calling another pavan and this another pavan is looking at another pavan\n",
      "[('pavan', 4), ('another', 3), ('is', 2)]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from collections import Counter\n",
    "import string\n",
    "\n",
    "string_list = \"Hey there !!! Pavan is calling another Pavan and this another pavan is looking at another pavan\"\n",
    "\n",
    "def word_ferquency(strr):\n",
    "    strr2 = strr.lower().translate(str.maketrans(\"\",\"\",string.punctuation))\n",
    "    return Counter(strr2.split()).most_common(3)\n",
    "print(word_ferquency(string_list))\n",
    "\n",
    "fixed_string = string_list.lower().translate(str.maketrans(\"\",\"\",string.punctuation))\n",
    "print(f\"using Collections.counter to count the frequecy of a character/string \\nFixed String : {fixed_string}\\n{Counter(fixed_string.split(\" \")).most_common(3)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md000009",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Palindrome / anagram\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Anagram:** same characters, same counts → `Counter(a) == Counter(b)`.\n",
    "- ⚠️ `check_palindrom` compares `str1` with reverse of `str2`; a real palindrome check uses **one** string.\n",
    "- ⚠️ `check_anagrams` counts spaces/punctuation (`'dormitory'` vs `'dirty room'` → `False`).\n",
    "- Needs `Counter` from the word-frequency cell.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "37df06e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "False\n",
      "Counter({'m': 2, 'a': 2})\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def check_palindrom(str1, str2):\n",
    "    return (str1.lower() == str2[::-1].lower())\n",
    "\n",
    "def check_anagrams(str1, str2):\n",
    "    return Counter(str1.lower()) == Counter(str2.lower())\n",
    "\n",
    "print(check_anagrams('mama', 'papa'))\n",
    "print(Counter('mama'))"
   ]
  },
  {
