    "### `isinstance` / `issubclass`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Takeaway:** every class in Python 3 inherits from `object`.\n",
    "\n",
    "- `isinstance(1.24, float)` → `True` (value is a float).\n",
    "- `issubclass(float, object)` → `True` (class check, not a value).\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "ccafab15",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "True\n",
      "True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(isinstance(1.24, float))\n",
    "print(issubclass(float, object))"
   ]
  },
