   "source": [
    "### `==` vs `is`\n",
    "\n",
    "- `==` → same **value** (calls `__eq__`)\n",
    "- `is` → same **object** (identity)\n",
    "\n",
    "Two equal lists: `==` True, `is` False. After `a = b`: `is` True.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "8cb33174",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "True\n",
      "False\n",
      "True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "a = [1,2,3,4]\n",
    "b = [1,2,3,4]\n",
    "print(a==b)\n",
    "print(a is b)\n",
    "\n",
    "a = b\n",
    "print(a is b)"
   ]
  },
